# --- Deployment / live-host files (NEVER commit) ---
# These live only on the VPS and contain live credentials. They were previously
# excluded via .git/info/exclude, which is local-only and is lost on any fresh
# clone or .git rebuild. Duplicated here so the protection is version-controlled
# and travels with the repo. sync.sh runs `git add -A` on a 2-minute timer, so
# this list is the last line of defence.
Caddyfile
docker-compose.yml
.deploy-key
sync.sh
sync.log
*.service
*.timer

# Credentials / keys, belt-and-braces
*.key
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
*.log
